          "",
          "第一问：这个词不认识，会不会影响当前这道题？如果不影响，直接跳过。不要为了一个无关生词停一分\n钟。"
        ]
      ],
      "text": " | 第一问：这个词不认识，会不会影响当前这道题？如果不影响，直接跳过。不要为了一个无关生词停一分\n钟。",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2961
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 先判断它是否影响当前题的定位或选项判断。",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2962
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 不影响 → 跳过，继续读主干。",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2963
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 影响 → 看词性：名词/动词/形容词/副词？",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2964
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 看前后有没有转折、因果、举例、同义解释。",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2965
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 看构词：un-/dis-/re- 等前缀，-tion/-ive/-ly 等后缀。",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2966
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6. 用上下文猜“方向和大概类别”即可，不要求字典级中文翻译。",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2967
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Example",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2968
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The device is compact, so it can easily fit into a small bag.",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2969
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "如果不认识 compact，后面的结果 “fit into a small bag” 已经告诉你它大概表示“小巧/不占空间”。做",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2970
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题够用了。",
      "sourcePage": 119,
      "sourceIndex": 2971
    }
  ],
